    "text": "Siskiyou County, California\nCAL FIRE Siskiyou Unit contains Jade Fire, evacuations downgraded\nBy Lauren Pretto,10 hours ago\nMONTAGUE, Ore.- Evacuation orders have been downgraded to normal as a vegetation fire is fully contained by the CAL FIRE Siskiyou unit. The Jade Fire in Montague was mapped at just over three acres. The fire has been 100% contained. The Siskiyou County Sheriff’s Office temporarily issued an evacuation order...\nComments\nLoading editor...",
